OL,3,GNEWSARevamped leisure centre may not
OL,4,Aopen for two years
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe redevelopment of a 1960s swimming
OL,7,Fpool may not be completed for another
OL,8,Ftwo years, a council report has
OL,9,Frevealed.
OL,11,FFenland District Council has been
OL,12,Fconsidering the future of the Manor
OL,13,FLeisure Centre in Whittlesey, near
OL,14,FPeterborough, since May 2024.
OL,16,FIt had been hoped work would start on
OL,17,Fmodernising the site in November, but
OL,18,Fthis was held up after the project's
OL,19,Fmain contractor went into
OL,20,Fadministration in May.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
