OL,3,GNEWSARevamped leisure centre may not
OL,4,Aopen for two years
OL,5,
OL,6,FA report prepared for the council's
OL,7,FConservative cabinet said the
OL,8,Fredevelopment would cost #23m,
OL,9,Fincluding #2.5m of funding from Sport
OL,10,FEngland.
